      "en": "King Rehoboam solidified his rule in Jerusalem;[NOTE:1] he[NOTE:2] was forty-one years old when he became king, and he ruled for seventeen years in Jerusalem, the city the Lord chose from all the tribes of Israel to be his home.[NOTE:3] Rehoboam’s[NOTE:4] mother was an Ammonite named Naamah.",
